    "key": "verdict",
    "label": "Verdict card",
    "html": "<div class=\"measure-frame py-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 items-start\"><figure class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-lg border border-line/[0.09] bg-paper-dark/40 p-6\"><span class=\"sl-tag sl-tag--warm self-start\">objection</span><blockquote class=\"font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-ink text-balance\">“Per-seat pricing punishes exactly the teams you want expanding. I’d cap it.”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mt-auto font-sans text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Marcus Hale</span><span class=\"text-ink/50\"> · CFO · scale-up</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-lg border border-line/[0.09] bg-paper-dark/40 p-6\"><span class=\"sl-tag self-start\">conditional</span><blockquote class=\"font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-ink text-balance\">“I’d trial it — but only if the export is auditable end to end.”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mt-auto font-sans text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Dana Ortiz</span><span class=\"text-ink/50\"> · Head of PM</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-lg border border-line/[0.09] bg-paper-dark/40 p-6\"><span class=\"sl-tag self-start\">stance-shift</span><blockquote class=\"font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-ink text-balance\">“I came in skeptical; the grounded quotes changed my mind.”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mt-auto font-sans text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Priya Nair</span><span class=\"text-ink/50\"> · Solo founder</span></figcaption></figure></div></div>",
