   "": "<section class=\"page-section page-section-compact\"><div class=\"mb-10 max-w-2xl lg:mb-12\"><div class=\"mb-4 h-0.5 w-8 bg-gold opacity-70\"></div><p class=\"sl-eyebrow text-xs text-blueprint mb-4\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-ink/25 tracking-wider mr-3\">01</span>How it works</p><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink tracking-tight text-balance\">One engine. Three ways to consume it.</h2><div class=\"mt-4 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/60 sm:text-base\">A calm section header — a kicker (optional index), a balanced title, and a lead paragraph.</div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-dashed border-line/20 px-8 py-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed tracking-wider text-ink/40\">Prices shown are placeholders pending validation — final pricing may change.</div></div><div class=\"measure-frame mt-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"h-px w-full bg-line/[0.08]\"></div></div></section>"
